WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.447
A big feeling can make it hard

2
00:00:03.447 --> 00:00:06.475
to choose what to do.

3
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.699
Stop. Pause

4
00:00:09.699 --> 00:00:12.459
and notice how you feel.

5
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.453
Think. What could you say or do

6
00:00:18.453 --> 00:00:21.551
that is kind and safe?

7
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.262
Do. Try your choice.

8
00:00:25.262 --> 00:00:28.598
You can stop and think again.

